# Kersivo ProductRail

[`ProductRail`](src/components/shop/ProductRail.tsx) + [`initProductRail.ts`](src/lib/shop/initProductRail.ts) + [`productRail.css`](src/styles/components/productRail.css) is the **official Kersivo product carousel**. Reuse it for product strips (landing shop preview, PDP "You may also like", etc.). Do not invent a second horizontal product carousel.

## BLACKLINE mount (canonical)

```tsx
<ProductRail
  products={carouselProducts}
  productHrefBase="/demo/shop" // required for real PDP hrefs
  variant="blackline"
  density="editorial"
  showAction="add-to-cart"
  showControls
  showProgress
  shopName="BLACKLINE"
/>
```

- BLACKLINE + ATC renders [`StorefrontProductCard`](src/components/shop/storefront/StorefrontProductCard.tsx) (bag icon, demo prices). Do not reimplement those cards in the rail.
- Edge "more content" fade lives in `productRail.css` (mask on the track via `data-can-scroll-*`). Do not add a white overlay.
- Section titles (e.g. "You may also like", "THE PRODUCTS WE USE") stay **outside** the rail; the rail header is controls + progress only.
- Map `StorefrontProduct` → `CarouselProduct` with `storefrontProductToCarousel` when the host already has storefront products.

## Init

`ProductRail` self-binds on mount (`initProductRails` / `destroyProductRails` on its root). Host pages may still call `initProductRails()` globally (idempotent). Do not require every host to remember init for a drop-in reuse.

## Anti-patterns

- New `.related-products-carousel` / custom snap rails for products
- Duplicating edge-fade or ATC icon styles outside `productRail.css` / storefront card path
- `previewMode` on BLACKLINE (Kersivo marketing only)
- `density="editorial"` without `showAction="add-to-cart"` when you need ATC storefront cards
